database.sqlite

# Third-party admin tools. A full phpMyAdmin install (thousands of files) does not
# belong in this repo, and shipping it to a public web root is a known attack
# surface - it gives anyone who finds the path a login prompt straight to MySQL.
# If a server needs it, install it separately from the deployed codebase.
/phpmyadmin/
